  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven equation : 63 + 5 ÷ 35 - 7 × 21 = 23\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the mathematical signs:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷ and ×\n\n63 + 5 ÷ 35 - 7 × 21 = 23 ⇒ 63 + 5 × 35 - **7 ÷ 21**__ = 23\n\n63 + __**5 **____**×**____** 35**__ - 0.33 = 23\n\n__**63 + 175**__ - 0.33 = 23\n\n__**238 - 0.33**__ = 23\n\n237.67 ≠ 23 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : × and +\n\n63 + 5 ÷ 35 - 7 × 21 = 23 ⇒ 63 × **5 ÷ 35**__ - 7 + 21 = 23\n\n__**63 × **____0.14__ - 7 + 21 = 23\n\n__**9 + 21**__ - 7 = 23\n\n__**30 - 7**__ = 23\n\n**23 = 23 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷ and +\n\n63 + 5 ÷ 35 - 7 × 21 = 23 ⇒ **63 ÷ 5**__ + 35 - 7 × 21 = 23\n\n12.6 + 35 - __**7 × 21**__ = 23\n\n__**12.6 **____**+ 35**__ - 147 = 23\n\n__**47.6 - 147**__ = 23\n\n-99.4 ≠ 23 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : + and - \n\n63 + 5 ÷ 35 - 7 × 21 = 23 ⇒ 63 - **5 ÷ 35**__ + 7 × 21 = 23\n\n63 - 0.14 + __**7 × 21**__ = 23\n\n__**63 + 147**__ - 0.14 = 23\n\n__**210 - 0.14**__ = 23\n\n209.86 ≠ 23 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
